---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About" description="About Aditya Singh Ramola: finance graduate in Delhi working on small projects in markets, money and policy.">
  <section class="wrap about">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="first">
        I'm Aditya Singh Ramola, a finance graduate based in Delhi. I'm most interested in how markets price things, how
        people actually make money decisions, and how policy shifts both.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site is where I keep the small projects: a dataset I wanted to look at properly, a model I built to test an
        idea, an analysis that started as a hunch. They're built in public, so some are finished and some are half way.
        Each project page says which.
      </p>
      <p>
        Longer essays on finance, politics, marketing and thinking live on
        <a href="https://neuropolicycognita.org">NeuroPolicy Cognita</a>, my writing site.
      </p>
      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        If you want to talk about one of these projects, or have data I should look at, write to me through the
        <a href="https://neuropolicycognita.org/contact">NeuroPolicy Cognita contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-top: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5rem);
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .first {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
</style>
